# Git and PR Rules

Read `docs/agents/git-workflow.md` before branching or opening PRs.

- Branch format: `feat/<issue>-<description>`
- One issue per branch; one focused change set per PR
- Target PR size: under 400 lines; split larger work into stacked PRs
- PR must link to issue: `Closes #N`
- Never force-push to main, never auto-merge, never skip hooks without user approval
- Do not commit unless user explicitly asks
